Minecraft assets

This license covers the pack's own work only. Some textures are derived from
Minecraft's own art: the Broken item sprites are vanilla item sprites with a
crack drawn through them, and the gravestone's carved face is the vanilla
polished andesite texture. The pack also points at vanilla textures and sounds
by name. Those assets remain the property of Mojang Studios / Microsoft and are
used under the Minecraft Usage Guidelines (https://www.minecraft.net/usage-guidelines);
this license grants no rights to them.

This pack is not an official Minecraft product and is not approved by or
associated with Mojang or Microsoft.
